From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:11:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Loyalty: WhatsApp-OTP redemption, points expiry, 2% default
 earn, fix spent-points wipe

- bot/redeem.js: request first sends a 6-digit WhatsApp code; only a matching code (3 tries, 10 min, 3 codes/phone/10 min) deducts points
- bot/index.js: earn transaction no longer drops pointsSpent; lapsed balances are written off
- default earn 1 point per Rs50 (was Rs20); new expiryDays setting (180 default in Admin; existing configs stay never-expire in the bot)
- Admin loyalty tab: expiry field; menu app: code prompt and lapsed balance display
- tests/loyalty-redeem.check.cjs

